{
  "name": "ZHHInAppMessage",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "summary": "应用内消息卡片：主题铺底、滑动关闭、串行队列。",
  "description": "ZHHInAppMessage 是轻量应用内消息组件（当前以卡片为主）：\n\n• 消息卡片：图标 / 标题 / 正文 / 按钮四槽，或完全自定义内容布局\n• 主题铺底、滑动关闭、遮罩模式、同侧叠卡\n• 去重、按 id 隐藏，以及 show/hide 生命周期回调\n\n默认安装 `Source` subspec（Development Pods 中单组展示源码树）。\n无第三方依赖，仅依赖系统 UIKit。\n横幅、通知列表与持久化见后续 Roadmap。",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/yue5yueliang/ZHHInAppMessage",
  "license": {
    "type": "MIT",
    "file": "LICENSE"
  },
  "authors": {
    "桃色三岁": "136769890@qq.com"
  },
  "source": {
    "git": "https://github.com/yue5yueliang/ZHHInAppMessage.git",
    "tag": "1.0.0"
  },
  "platforms": {
    "ios": "15.0"
  },
  "swift_versions": "5.0",
  "frameworks": "UIKit",
  "resource_bundles": {
    "ZHHInAppMessage": [
      "ZHHInAppMessage/PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy"
    ]
  },
  "default_subspecs": "Source",
  "subspecs": [
    {
      "name": "Source",
      "source_files": "ZHHInAppMessage/Classes/**/*"
    }
  ],
  "swift_version": "5.0"
}
